\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\kerning1\f0\fs22 WebNavigator is a Chromium-based browser that aims to simplify your browsing experience. It provides quick access to your bookmarks and quick search results by starting up with Windows. Let it run in the background and be amazed at how fast the browser opens when you need it. Easily transition from your current default browser by importing all your existing settings.\par
By clicking \ldblquote Accept and Install\rdblquote  you understand and acknowledge that you are choosing to install the WebNavigator software on your system. The software needs to communicate to our servers to deliver the functionality described above, and to record anonymous usage data and statistics.\par
WebNavigator default search is powered Yahoo! or other partners, to deliver the best possible search experience. WebNavigator will receive a share of the revenue generated by these partners on their search results pages. To make it possible, search requests may be redirected through servers belonging to us or our search partners. WebNavigator will not interfere in any way with your search queries nor with the search results provided by its partners. You can remove the application at any time. Visit {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://webnavigator.co/uninstall.html }}{\fldrslt{https://webnavigator.co/uninstall.html\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22  for further instructions.\par
